:INFO
Art. 48 Implementation
The FOCBS and the certification offices shall be responsible for implementation.
|

:INFO
Art. 49 Repeal of current legislation
The Ordinance of 4 July 1984 on the Certification of Origin is repealed.
|

:NOTE
[AS 1984 913; 1987 2675; 1993 2429; 2000 187 Art. 21 No 20; 2006 2995 Annex 4 No II 16, 4705 No II 110]
|

:INFO
Art. 50 Amendment of current legislation
The amendment of current legislation is set out in the Annex.
|

:INFO
Art. 51 Transitional provision
Agreements falling under Article 20 that have been concluded on the basis of Article 12a of the Ordinance of 4 July 1984 on the Certification of Origin shall remain valid.
|

:NOTE
[AS 1984 913; 1987 2675; 1993 2429; 2000 187 Art. 21 No 20; 2006 2995 Annex 4 No II 16, 4705 No II 110]
|

:INFO
Art. 52 Commencement
This Ordinance come into force on 1 May 2008.

